    "preamble": "Ashok Chouhan vs The State Of Jharkhand ..... Opp . ... on 2 January, 2019 Equivalent citations: Aironline 2019 Jha 390 Author: Anant Bijay Singh Bench: Anant Bijay Singh In The High Court Of Jharkhand At Ranchi Cr. Revision No. 679 of 2003 Ashok Chouhan ..... Petitioner Versus The State of Jharkhand ..... Opp. Parties --------- Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Anant Bijay Singh --------- For the Petitioner : Mr. Binod Kr. Dubey, Advocate.",
    "facts": "",
